sequenceDiagram
  actor U as 用户
  participant A as API
  participant D as StorageBackend SQLite v1
  participant W as Worker
  participant G as LangGraph
  participant P as 动作策略
  W->>G: 执行
  G->>D: pending interrupt 检查点
  G-->>W: 中断载荷
  W->>D: waiting / Interrupt / Event
  W->>D: 释放活动执行租约
  A-->>U: 问题或动作摘要
  U->>A: interrupt_id / revision / response
  A->>P: 校验身份、权限和参数摘要
  P-->>A: 决策
  A->>D: ResumeRequest / queued / Job 事务
  A-->>U: 202
  W->>D: 重新领取并读取检查点
  W->>G: Command(resume)
  G->>D: 保存 last_applied_resume_id
  W->>D: 标记 applied
